  "question": {
    "text": "At $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$, the ionic product of water is $10^{-14}$. The free energy change for the self-ionization of water in $\\mathrm{kCal}^{-1} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$ is close to",
